description\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">The BCA programme at SOC gives you a solid foundation in programming, software development, database management and emerging tech while preparing you for immediate employment or further study.</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>Program Highlights</strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"15\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&middot;<span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt Times New Roman;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]-->Computer programming languages, DBMS, software development, cloud computing, cybersecurity and web technologies.</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"15\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&middot;<span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt Times New Roman;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]-->Industry projects to bridge the gap between theory and practical application.</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>Career Pathways</strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">Graduates can pursue careers as software developers, data analysts, IT consultants or pursue higher studies like MCA.</p>\",\n    \"eligibility\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>Duration:</strong>&nbsp;3 Years</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">Eligibility &ndash; 10+ 2 in any stream except Agriculture.</p>\",\n    \"fee_structure\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": 25,\n    \"name\": \" MCA (Integrated) \",\n    \"description\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">The Integrated MCA is the fastest, most seamless path from school to a master's qualification in computer science.</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>Program Highlights </strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"15\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&middot;<span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt Times New Roman;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]-->Focus on technologies like IoT, Blockchain and AI.</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"15\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&middot;<span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt Times New Roman;\\\">&nbsp;</span></span><!--[endif]-->Comprehensive industry internships for hands-on experience</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>Career pathways </strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">Find advanced roles in software engineering, project management and technology innovation.</p>\",\n    \"eligibility\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>Duration:</strong>&nbsp;5 Years</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">Eligibility &ndash; 10+2 with Mathematics/Accounts/Statistics</p>\",\n    \"fee_structure\": {}\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": 83,\n    \"name\": \"MCA (Master of Computer Applications)\",\n    \"description\": \"<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">Take your technical expertise to the next level. The MCA programme is designed for graduates who want to deepen their specialisation and step into senior technical or managerial roles in the industry.</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>Program Highlights</strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"15\\\">&middot;&nbsp;Specialisation in AI, machine learning, big data analytics, and hands-on training with industry tools.</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"15\\\">&middot;&nbsp;Research opportunities for publishing research papers in national and international journals.</p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><strong>Career Pathways</strong></p>\\r\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">An MCA opens up opportunities in data science, AI, IoT, machine learning, data analysis among other emerging possibilities.</p>\",\n    \"eligibility\": \"<p><strong>Duration: </strong>2 Years</p>\\r\\n<p>Eligibility - Any Graduate with Mathematics or &nbsp;10+2 with Mathematics</p>\",\n    \"fee_structure\": {}\n  }\n]\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
