0px);text-align:center;border-radius:8px;\\n            height:100%;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;box-sizing:border-box;\\\">\\n\\n<h1 style=\\\"color:#1a2a44;margin:0 0 15px;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,4vw,2.4rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;\\\">\\nReady to start your tech career? \\n</h1>\\n\\n<p style=\\\"color:#555555;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 25px;font-size:clamp(14px,2vw,16px);font-weight:600;line-height:1.8;\\\">\\nJoin a community of tech experts at the School of Computers at IPS Academy, Indore. Get ready for a dream career. \\n</p>\\n\\n<ul style=\\\"margin:0 auto 30px;max-width:800px;padding:0 10px;list-style:none;box-sizing:border-box;\\\">\\n\\n<li style=\\\"color:#002147;font-size:clamp(13px,1.8vw,15px);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\\\">\\n✔ Industry Oriented Programs\\n</li>\\n\\n<li style=\\\"color:#002147;font-size:clamp(13px,1.8vw,15px);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\\\">\\n✔ 100% Placement Assistance\\n</li>\\n\\n<li style=\\\"color:#002147;font-size:clamp(13px,1.8vw,15px);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\\\">\\n✔ Modern Infrastructure\\n</li>\\n\\n<li style=\\\"color:#002147;font-size:clamp(13px,1.8vw,15px);font-weight:600;\\\">\\n✔ Scholarship Options Available\\n</li>\\n\\n</ul>\\n\\n<div>\\n<a href=\\\"soc/contact\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;background:#0d6efd;color:#ffffff;padding:clamp(10px,2vw,14px) clamp(20px,4vw,35px);text-decoration:none;border-radius:5px;font-size:clamp(14px,2vw,16px);font-weight:600;\\ntransition:background 0.3s ease;\\\">\\nContact Us\\n</a>\\n</div>\\n<br>\\n</div>\\n\"\n    },\n    \"just_above_the_footer_1\": {\n      \"type\": \"scratch\",\n      \"sort_order\": 19,\n      \"html\": \"<div class=\\\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4\\\"><div class=\\\"pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!\\\"><div class=\\\"sticky bg-token-border-light\\\"></div></div></div><div data-custom-highlighting-behavior=\\\"boundary\\\" class=\\\"relative\\\"><div class=\\\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\\\"><div class=\\\"h-full min-h-0 min-w-0\\\"><div class=\\\"\\\"><div class=\\\"relative [container-type:inline-size]\\\"><div class=\\\"w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto\\\"><div class=\\\"relative z-0 flex max-w-full\\\"><div id=\\\"code-block-viewer\\\" dir=\\\"ltr\\\" class=\\\"q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr\\\"><div class=\\\"cm-scroller\\\"><pre class=\\\"cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0\\\" style=\\\"text-align: center; \\\"><br></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"scratch-raw-html\\\" data-raw=\\\"1\\\" style=\\\"position: relative; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0px;\\\"><div class=\\\"raw-html-inner\\\"><div style=\\\"display:flex; justify-content:center; align-items:center; width:100%; margin:20px 0;\\\">\\n    <a href=\\\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1tHnpQUDAVWU7AkENzmbJGLYTiKx_IUgO/view?usp=sharing\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" style=\\\"display: inline-block; width: 100%; max-width: 320px; text-align: center; background: rgb(13, 110, 253); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); padding: 14px 20px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; box-sizing: border-box; transition: background-color 0.3s;\\\" onmouseover=\\\"this.style.background='#0b5ed7';\\\" onmouseout=\\\"this.style.background='#0d6efd';\\\">\\n        Mandatory Disclosure PDF\\n    </a>\\n</div></div></div><p></p>\"\n    },\n    \"testimonials\": {\n      \"type\": \"testimonials\",\n      \"sort_order\": 20,\n      \"items\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Nikita katariya\",\n          \"image\": \"https://portal.ipsa.ac.in/uploads/editor_images/biy2upzrbfb8vjvsophc.webp\",\n          \"story\": \"I am very thankful to SOC,IPSA for providing me the opportunity to get into my Dream Job. They have helped me to learn the skills that are needed in the current tech world and also guided me and identified my potential to grow and learn faster. The learner-centric environment and infrastructure along with the guidance and support from our faculty members have led me to obtain my Dream Job. The campus curriculum and also lots of competitions  have also helped me to increase my knowledge of the tech field and also improved my ability to learn faster. I am very thankful to SOC,IPSA and its faculty for helping to obtain my Dream Job.\",\n          \"designation\": \"SOC ALUMNI | Placed in Lensesoft\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Aniket Date\",\n          \"image\": \"https://portal.ipsa.ac.in/uploads/editor_images/u8lnyxp8plvcpadsimvu.webp\",\n          \"story\": \"I am honored to be an alumni of the MCA at SOC,IPSA. Words cannot describe the gratitude and the pleasure I feel toward each of my faculty who contributed in my success. The MCA program helped me in introducing myself to well-known firms and organizations at various competitions. Such events prepared me to be a skilled public speaker and an active team member who can achieve successes in the professional work field. Our great professors specifically focused on giving real life examples and  responded with valuable feedback. The MCA program was an essential key in elevating my career to a higher level. I was able to find a great job at Amsterdam, Netherlands as Ops Developer at ROBO BANK . The MCA program was such an excellent experience and worth the time and effort spent in strengthening my knowledge and improving my professional career.\",\n          \"designation\": \"SOC ALUMNI | Placed in HotWax Systems\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Priyanka Pandit\",\n          \"image\": \"https://portal.ipsa.ac.in/uploads/editor_images/itqmtzzzgjqx8jgsbocu.webp\",\n          \"story\": \"SOC has been a great contributor in the development of my personality. I have established my leadership, time management and team skills and have also been able to advance these skills to the whole new augment level. The professors here have an attitude of being ever ready to help, and not only delivering classroom teachings, but they are also the pillars of the learning. I have gained a lot from this institute and this is a treasure for life. My two years at IPSA were great and full of learning and helped to groom myself. I am thankful to all the faculties and mentors Overall it was a great experience and lifetime memory.\\n\",\n          \"designation\": \"SOC Alumni | Placed in Tech Mahindra \"\n        },\n        {\n          \"name\": \"yashraj Singh Solanki\",\n          \"image\": \"https://portal.ipsa.ac.in/uploads/editor_images/dpne9i1d5lfmgzoexghi.webp\",\n          \"story\": \"My journey at the School of Computers, IPS Academy has been truly memorable and transformative. During my time here, I was able to develop important skills l\n=== official_portal_api_soc_pages_placements.json\n{\n  \"college\": \"soc\",\n  \"page\": \"placements\",\n  \"title\": \"Placements\",\n  \"meta_description\": null,\n  \"meta_title\": null,\n  \"meta_keywords\": null,\n  \"canonical_url\": null,\n  \"robots\": \"index, follow\",\n  \"og_title\": null,\n  \"og_description\": null,\n  \"og_image\": null,\n  \"twitter_title\": null,\n  \"twitter_description\": null,\n  \"twitter_image\": null,\n  \"schema_markup\": null,\n  \"sections\": {\n    \"hero\": {\n      \"type\": \"hero\",\n      \"sort_order\": 0,\n      \"images\": [\n        \"https://portal.ipsa.ac.in/uploads/sections/hero/ugubixgeq4fymd0bfqi5.webp\"\n      ],\n      \"cta_link\": \"\",\n      \"cta_text\": \"\",\n      \"description\": \"Your Launchpad for\\nSuccess\"\n    },\n    \"about_ips\": {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"sort_order\": 1,\n      \"image\": \"\",\n      \"title\": \"Where Opportunities Find You\",\n      \"content\": \"At the Central Placement Cell, we offer comprehensive placement support that is designed to prepare our students for success; from campus life to a thriving career. Whether you're aiming for a specific industry or a particular role, our nationally recognized placement cell is committed to equipping you for success in an increasingly competitive job market.\"\n    },\n    \"an_infrastructure\": {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"sort_order\": 2,\n      \"image\": \"\",\n      \"title\": \"An infrastructure designed to make your ideas happen\",\n      \"content\": \"Bring your ideas and make them successful growth stories at the IPS Academy Incubation Centre.  Our multidisciplinary hub brings together students, faculty, and alumni from all departments to build solutions that matter. \"\n    },\n    \"vibrant_entreprenurial\": {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"sort_order\": 3,\n      \"image\": \"\",\n      \"title\": \"Vibrant Entreprenurial Ecosystem\",\n      \"content\": \"The Incubation Centre reflects IPS Academy’s commitment to holistic, future-oriented education - shaping graduates who think boldly, act responsibly and create meaningful impact. \"\n    },\n    \"a_collaboration\": {\n      \"type\": \"text\",\n      \"sort_order\": 4,\n      \"image\": \"\",\n      \"title\": \"A Collaboration Across Disciplines\",\n      \"content\": \"Diverse minds from multiple disciplines and skillsets come together to build bold, relevant and real-world-ready ventures at the IPSA Incubation Centre. \"\n    },\n    \"orientation_and_awareness\": {\n      \"type\": \"stats\",\n      \"sort_order\": 5,\n      \"stats\": [\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Orientation and awareness\",\n          \"value\": \"Talks, lectures and discussions that introduce students to start-ups, innovation and entrepreneurial thinking.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Skill-building workshops\",\n          \"value\": \"Sessions on business modelling, design thinking, digital marketing, finance, IPR, pitching and more.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Idea development\",\n          \"value\": \"Hackathons, challenges and competitions to refine ideas, validate problems and shape strong value propositions.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Incubation and mentoring\",\n          \"value\": \"Structured support from industry experts, faculty mentors and alumni entrepreneurs to guide product development, market entry and scaling.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Exposure and networking\",\n          \"value\": \"Pitch days, investor collaborations with corporates, government bodies and ecosystem partners.\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"label\": \"Infrastructure support \",\n          \"value\": \"Meeting rooms, high-speed internet, essential office facilities and access to labs, studios and prototyping spaces across IPS Academy’s institutes. \"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"the_placement_team\": {\n      \"type\": \"team\",\n      \"sort_order\": 6,\n      \"title\": \"The Placement Team\",\n      \"members\": [\n        {\n          \"name\": \"Dr. Nihit Jaiswal\",\n          \"image\": \"\",\n          \"title\": \"General Manager\",\n          \"description\": \"A Ph.D. in Management, and an MBA in Marketing from IBS Mumbai Campus, a Top Business School in India, and is a Microsoft Certified Educator. A Pro Marketer and thorough professional skilled in Liaising, Campus Recruitment, Diversity & Inclusion, Career Planning Activities, Corporate Affairs, and Talent Management. He has completed MDP from IIM, Indore on Capacity Building. He is also a Nodal Officer for the \\\"Internship, Training & Placement Cell (ITP Cell)\\\" for the Indore Region at Rajiv Gandhi Proudyogiki Vishwavidyalaya(RGPV), Bhopal. He has 15 years of experience in campus placement.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"testimonials\": {\n      \"type\": \"testimonials\",\n      \"sort_order\": 7,\n      \"items\": [],\n      \"title\": \"\"\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
